abstract: >-
  A Python framework for bilateral automated negotiation and
  opponent-model assessment, with configurable tournaments,
  negotiation agents, preference estimators, logs and a local web interface.
keywords:
  - automated negotiation
  - multi-agent systems
  - opponent modeling
  - negotiation simulation
